1
00:00:02,690 --> 00:00:08,493
Every dancer on the block knew the rule. You get six seconds on camera. Make them count.

2
00:00:08,663 --> 00:00:11,073
RICO: Yo! Watch this! One spin, two spin, freeze!

3
00:00:11,243 --> 00:00:15,382
ZOE: Six seconds? I've seen you practice that freeze for six months.

4
00:00:15,552 --> 00:00:18,715
RICO: Then watch me land it in six seconds. DJ, drop it!

5
00:00:22,225 --> 00:00:28,983
RICO: Six seconds on the clock, no fear in my shoes. Every bruise was a lesson, every fall was a clue. Spin once, spin twice, now the whole block stop. Freeze!
